first of all um  i just wanted to ask your understanding  of the latest situation in mario paul  the city is totally under siege  surrounded by enemy russian troops  without electricity water heating  without telephone reception in total  deep silence because all the buildings  and residential buildings have been  destroyed people are now sheltering in  basements and are waiting for full  evacuation  we've seen what happened in  butcher  how does that compare do you think to  what must have happened in mariopol it  was  you know when we talk about the horrors  seen by the whole civilized world today  in butcher in order to imagine what is  now happening in mariupol you have to  multiply that horror by a factor of 10  then you will understand what horror has  now taken place in mario pal so butcher  has a population of 40 000 people  mariopol has a half a million  residents  and it was mercilessly shelled by enemy  artillery and from  ships and  using grout systems and the buratina  flame thrower and by heavy  do you have an estimate on the number of  civilian casualties  before the 21st of march we managed to  record  the dead marijuana residents we were  burying them in mass graves  unfortunately by then we had  recorded the death toll of 5 000  civilians i must also stress that  shelling continued in the number of  bodies lying on the streets which we  hadn't managed to collect counted in  thousands  sky news interviewed dmitry peskov last  night  i want to ask you a little bit about  what he said  he said that mario paul is part of the  independent state of luhansk  and he wanted to assist  them  in their  being independent  and assist them from heavy suffering  that they had  from ukrainian forces  in the past over the last eight years  [Music]  yeah first of all  must  learn geography better part of lugansk  was never connected in any way with the  mariupl mariupol was part of the  nietzsche region and when in 2014 and  2015 they tried to capture the city of  mariopol then it was mariupol residents  did everything to prevent that it become  part of the so-called danish people's  republic and i think that's when this  anger was born against marijuana and all  those atrocities and destruction and  thousands of marijuana residents it  shows that it was then that mariupol  refused to bow to the so-called great  federation of russia and remained part  of an independent democratic ukraine  but  according to vladimir putin's spokesman  your city needs to be liberated  from nationalistic battalions  when putin says that we need to be  liberated from nationalists then how do  you see that they destroyed the city by  90 percent it means that in every  building in the city of marijuana all  the residents were nationalists my  mother my brother their families all the  peaceful children sheltering in the  drama theater on which they dropped two  air bombs all those people all those  pregnant women in the maternity hospital  which was also hit by an airstrike and  also the hospital where 50 wounded  people civilian people were burnt were  they all nationalists but are there  nationalists  who are terrorizing mariopol  this is just a myth this is just a  russian propaganda and the narrative  which they try to  use to brainwash their own citizens  russian citizens to justify those  atrocities which they uh commit  committed an arca meeting in ukraine you  must understand that uh russian speaking  people live in uh marijuana 98 of the  population speak russian and uh half of  the population are ethnic russians this  is all lies spread by putin himself  together with his so-called leaders of  this special operation  how has the feeling of the people of  mariopol changed  in the last  few weeks in the last since this  invasion started how is how is that  sentiment towards russia changed  yeah i want to reassure you firmly that  the attitude has changed radically we  understand now very clearly what kind of  voice is and when vladimir putin said in  the autumn that there is no such nation  as ukrainians i want to assure you that  he has done everything with this war  that this nation we you as ukrainians no  matter what our ethnic origin is all the  residents of ukraine jews polls ethnic  ukrainians or russians armenians as  aries they have all become one nation  one ukrainian nation i just wanted to  get your reaction to  um  what's happened today at kramatosk  there's been two missiles hitting  the station  it looks like civilians have been killed  at least 30.  yes more than 30 civilians died today as  a result of these atrocities and strikes  committed by the russian federation  against the peaceful kramatorsk at the  time when people  were trying to evacuate  civilians children elderly women waiting  for a train to go to a safer area of  ukraine the cynicism which were  witnessed in mariupol when they  were shelling the drummers theater or  the maternity hospital so those uh  russian telegram channels and the social  media when they said that they should  take evacuation trains so they knew in  advance that they would commit this  crime and which they have committed  today it looks as if russia is  has  you know it is withdrawn from areas  around kiev and that it may well focus  now on the east  and the south of ukraine  what do you think is going to happen  and what do you think  the west should do about it  we understand that the main water day  now will be fought for donetsk and  lagasse regions that all the forces will  be concentrated there and the result of  all this will be decided on the  battlefield and we have to prepare now  for what is happening today those cities  that are being hit by those missile  strikes there will be airstrikes as well  those cities and towns have to prepare  to evacuate their civilians and to  prepare the two women children and the  elderly should leave those towns which  are now facing that threat  what what more should um countries like  the united kingdom the european union  and the americans  do we must understand that only economic  sanctions can stop now that army and  that leader who issued that criminal  order and only  economic and financial sanctions and  attack against his economy will work we  need a full embargo on the purchase of  russian oil and gas we understand that  only in the first quarter of this year  the russian federation has already  earned 35 billion  which it spends on the war with ukraine  by the end of the year they will earn  another 300 billion and if we don't  impose an embargo it's clear that the  russian federation will continue the war  and those who buy  those commodities they must understand  that their  co-finances of this war which is  destroying and raising to the ground  such cities as marijuana and butcher  finally  come bring back to our interview with  dmitry peskov yesterday  he said that  the images we've seen of  civilians who look like they've been  shot  are fake  he said that the hospital as we've heard  before  images we saw from maripo  were faked  um  how can you prove that they're not faked  there are many witnesses now the  witnesses of the tragic events in  mariopol in the drama theater my mom is  one of those witnesses she spent 20 days  there sheltering hiding against russian  strikes there are many witnesses who are  ready and are already giving evidence  against those  atrocities committed by the russian  federation and putin

